{"id":"23419e8036fb68bd","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-satisfaction.md","title":"一阶支撑语言的满足关系","display":"df-satisfaction — 一阶支撑语言的满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-satisfaction","aliases":["18-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 一阶支撑语言的满足关系","depends_on":["[[18-df-assignment]]","[[18-df-formula]]","[[18-df-structure]]","[[18-df-term-interpretation]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.2.7 (first-order comparison)","source_printed_pages":"49","source_pdf_pages":"59","source_correspondence":"supplementary-first-order-interface","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 一阶支撑语言的满足关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01ff954c42fa05a6\" href=\"?note=01ff954c42fa05a6\" title=\"18-df-term-interpretation\">18-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.2.7 (first-order comparison)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"49"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"supplementary-first-order-interface"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的公式树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in R_n\">\\(R\\in R_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,u,t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>项值与赋值更新见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"01ff954c42fa05a6\" href=\"?note=01ff954c42fa05a6\" title=\"18-df-term-interpretation\">18-df-term-interpretation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 对每个结构在有限公式树上递归定义；右侧的逻辑符号属于元语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\models(t\\doteq u)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\models(t\\doteq u)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\langle t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\rangle\\in R^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\neg\\varphi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\land(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\to\\psi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])\\lor(\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)[\\beta]&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[a/x]]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>修复遗漏等号、析取、蕴涵、存在量词分支的问题；现覆盖本地公式的每一种构造，结构递归给出唯一满足关系。原书 Definition 4.2.7 还包括关系变量原子式及二阶量词；本节点仅为一阶支撑接口，并非书中全部满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"95cd5e4d0506772c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","h