}_\\omega$ 是 [[./18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]] 中的具体句子集。$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L_\\in)$、$|\\mathfrak A|$、$\\in^{\\mathfrak A}$ 和 $\\models$ 见 [[./18-df-structure]]、[[./18-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pow}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)$ 是给定理论集合；$\\kappa:D\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是给定的对象句编码接口，$\\mathfrak N$ 是具有签名 $S$ 的给定算术结构，满足关系见 [[18-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"635d9c2a8b21701e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$ 为任意集合。$M\\ne\\varnothing$ 时，$\\mathfrak M_M$ 是下式的集合结构，满足关系与赋值更新取 [[18-df-satisfaction]]、[[18-df-assignment]]；$\\beta\\in M^W$ 是全部变量上的赋值。每个公式仅有有限多个自由变量，因此该赋值表达有限参数，不引入无限参数公式。空集情形由单独分支给出，不调用不存在赋值的空结构满足关系。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-satisfaction]]"}],"outgoing":["95cd5e4d0506772c","2718a8a11c383b33","9ac3a6265513490d","01ff954c42fa05a6"]}